    "summary": "The sweep that produced this file invoked train_feedback without --injection-scale. At that commit the flag was a plain argparse default of 10.0 that selected_feedback_config.json could not override, so the loop rung ran at injection_scale=10.0 on BOTH datasets instead of the selected 2.0 (UNSW) / 20.0 (ToN). The canonical Aug-27 run used the correct per-dataset scales.",
